# ---- [NT-FEAT 11] 逐像素阴影遮罩 ----
msgid "Copied lilToon per-pixel shadow masks (Strength / Border / Blur) into NonToon's ShadowColor module and enabled Use Shadow Masks."
msgstr "已把 lilToon 的逐像素阴影遮罩（强度 / 边界 / 模糊）复制到 NonToon 的 ShadowColor 模块，并打开了「使用阴影遮罩」。"

msgid "WARNING: the installed NonToon shader has no per-pixel shadow mask inputs; lilToon Shadow Strength/Border/Blur Masks were not copied."
msgstr "警告：已安装的 NonToon 着色器没有逐像素阴影遮罩输入，lilToon 的阴影强度/边界/模糊遮罩没有复制。"

msgid "Use Shadow Masks"
msgstr "使用阴影遮罩"

# ============================================================
# [NT-FEAT 20] ⑥ 实时自阴影（组件面板 + 安装器 + 菜单）
# ============================================================
msgid "This light must be anchored in front of / above the avatar, otherwise no self-occlusion is visible and the shadow looks like it does nothing. Use the Install button to build a properly anchored rig (Neck position + Chest aim)."
msgstr "这盏灯必须锚定在 avatar 的前上方：否则画面里看不到任何自遮挡，阴影会像是完全没生效。用下面的安装按钮可以一次生成正确的锚定灯架（PositionConstraint 跟脖子 + AimConstraint 看胸口）。"

msgid "Hard limits (VRChat)"
msgstr "VRChat 硬约束"

msgid "Realtime lights force the avatar to the Poor performance rank (Lights = 1) and are NOT available on Quest. Shadow quality depends on the viewer's own Unity quality settings. Do not use Unity's Soft shadows: this component turns the light's Unity shadow off on purpose and provides the shadow itself."
msgstr "实时光会把 avatar 强制打到 Poor 性能等级（Lights = 1），而且 Quest 完全不可用。半影质量取决于观看者自己的 Unity 画质设置。不要改用 Unity 的 Soft 阴影：本组件是故意关掉该灯的 Unity 阴影、由自己提供阴影的。"

msgid "Shadow Floor is 0: fully shadowed areas will go pure black unless the material's Light Min Limit is above 0 or there is ambient light. Raise it to 0.2-0.3 if the model turns black."
msgstr "阴影下限为 0：除非材质的 Light Min Limit 大于 0 或者场景有环境光，否则完全被遮蔽的地方会变成纯黑。模型如果发黑，把它调到 0.2~0.3。"

msgid "Modular Avatar was not found in this project. The rig can still be built, but the Expression Menu will not be wired automatically. Install Modular Avatar (VCC) and run Install again to use the declarative path."
msgstr "本工程里没找到 Modular Avatar。灯架仍然能建，但 Expression Menu 不会自动接上。装上 Modular Avatar（VCC）后再点一次安装即可走声明式路径。"

msgid "Modular Avatar detected: the menu is installed declaratively (MergeAnimator / Parameters / MenuItem / MenuInstaller). Your FX controller, ExpressionParameters and ExpressionsMenu are never modified."
msgstr "检测到 Modular Avatar：菜单会用声明式组件安装（MergeAnimator / Parameters / MenuItem / MenuInstaller），你的 FX 控制器、ExpressionParameters、ExpressionsMenu 都不会被改动。"

msgid "Install / update the rig on this avatar"
msgstr "在这只 avatar 上安装 / 更新灯架"

msgid "Uninstall from this avatar"
msgstr "从这只 avatar 卸载"

msgid "This component is not under a scene-root avatar; put it under the avatar or use Tools/NonToon menu."
msgstr "本组件不在场景根的 avatar 之下；请把它挂到 avatar 下面，或者用 Tools/NonToon 菜单。"

msgid "Install realtime self shadow"
msgstr "安装实时自阴影"

msgid "Uninstall realtime self shadow"
msgstr "卸载实时自阴影"

msgid "Realtime softness (Light Size)"
msgstr "实时软硬（灯尺寸）"

msgid "Realtime shadow floor"
msgstr "实时阴影下限"

msgid "Realtime shadow on/off"
msgstr "实时阴影开关"

msgid "The scene ambient light is near black. Areas outside this spot light cone have no other light source, so they render pure black. That is lighting setup, not the shadow. Restore ambient in the Lighting window, or widen Spot Angle and Range so the cone covers the whole body."
msgstr "场景环境光接近纯黑。这盏聚光灯锥体以外没有任何其它光源，所以那些地方会渲染成纯黑 —— 那是照明设置的问题，不是阴影。请在 Lighting 窗口恢复环境光，或者把 Spot Angle / Range 放宽到能覆盖整个身体。"

# ---- ⑥ 检视面板：字段分组标题 ----
msgid "Light"
msgstr "光源"

msgid "Shadow (PCSS)"
msgstr "阴影（PCSS）"

msgid "Depth map"
msgstr "深度图"

# ---- ⑥ 检视面板：字段标签 ----
# 为什么必须自己画标签：`DrawDefaultInspector()` 用 Unity 的字段名美化当标签，
# 于是显示成英文的 Target Light / Extra Casters / Light Size …，
# 而同一次绘制里 resolution / softness 又被 Unity 的中文本地化翻成中文 ⇒ 中英混排。
msgid "Shadow light"
msgstr "阴影光源"

msgid "Light intensity"
msgstr "灯强度"

msgid "Light color"
msgstr "灯颜色"

msgid "Realtime PCSS"
msgstr "实时 PCSS"

msgid "Virtual light size"
msgstr "虚拟灯半径"

msgid "Softness"
msgstr "柔和度"

msgid "Quality 0-3"
msgstr "采样档 0-3"

msgid "Shadow floor"
msgstr "阴影下限"

msgid "Depth bias (m)"
msgstr "深度偏移（米）"

msgid "Depth resolution"
msgstr "深度图分辨率"

msgid "Render depth every frame"
msgstr "每帧渲染深度图"

msgid "Extra casters"
msgstr "额外投影体"

msgid "Search root"
msgstr "搜索根节点"

msgid "Disable Unity shadows"
msgstr "关闭 Unity 阴影"

# ---- ⑥ 检视面板：字段提示 ----
msgid "The Spot light that provides the shadow. Leave empty to auto-find a Spot in children."
msgstr "提供阴影的那盏 Spot 光。留空则自动在子物体里找一盏 Spot。"

msgid "Light intensity driven by this component (written back to Light.intensity). Also exposed to the in-game Expression Menu."
msgstr "由本组件驱动的灯强度（会写回 Light.intensity）。它同时也接进了游戏内的 Expression Menu（「实时阴影 强度」）。"

msgid "Light color driven by this component."
msgstr "由本组件驱动的灯颜色。"

msgid "Master switch. The Expression Menu drives this field, so it can be toggled in game."
msgstr "总开关。ExpressionMenu 驱动的是这个字段，所以游戏内可以开关。"

msgid "Penumbra size (texels at a 512 reference). Larger is softer. Self-occlusion on an avatar is only a few centimetres, so 32-128 is the useful range."
msgstr "半影半径（以 512 纹素为基准）。越大越软。avatar 上的自遮挡距离只有几厘米，所以有效区间是 32~128。"

msgid "Extra soft/hard multiplier on top of the light size."
msgstr "在灯半径之上再乘一个软硬倍率。"

msgid "Sample budget: 0 = 8/12, 1 = 12/24, 2 = 16/32, 3 = 24/32. Higher is smoother and more expensive."
msgstr "采样预算：0 = 8/12、1 = 12/24、2 = 16/32、3 = 24/32。越高越平滑也越贵。"

msgid "How much of the light survives in fully shadowed areas (0 = pure black). NonToon then clamps env + light to [_LightMinLimit, _LightMaxLimit]; _LightMinLimit defaults to 0, so without a floor the model turns black where there is no ambient light."
msgstr "完全被遮蔽的地方保留多少比例的灯光（0 = 纯黑）。NonToon 随后会把 env + light 夹到 [_LightMinLimit, _LightMaxLimit]，而 _LightMinLimit 默认是 0，所以没有环境光时不留下限整个模型会发黑。"

msgid "Depth offset in metres, used to suppress shadow acne on self-occlusion."
msgstr "深度偏移（米），用来压掉自遮挡产生的阴影噪点（shadow acne）。"

msgid "Depth map resolution. 512 is enough; 1024 is finer but costs more."
msgstr "深度图分辨率。512 够用；1024 更细但更贵。"

msgid "Render the depth map every frame. Turn off for troubleshooting."
msgstr "每帧渲染深度图。关掉可以用于排查。"

msgid "Extra renderers that should cast into the depth map (the avatar itself is collected automatically)."
msgstr "额外要投进深度图的物体（avatar 自己会自动收集）。"

msgid "Root used to scan for casters and target materials. Leave empty to use the topmost parent of this object."
msgstr "扫描投影体与目标材质用的根节点。留空 = 自动取本物体所在层级的最顶层父节点。"

msgid "Turn the light's Unity realtime shadow off: the shadow is provided entirely by this component plus PCSS."
msgstr "把这盏灯的 Unity 实时阴影关掉：阴影完全由本组件 + PCSS 提供。"

# ---- ⑥ 检视面板：与 ⑤ 亮度调整的关系 ----
msgid "Too dark overall, especially where the light does not reach? Raise the material's Light Min Limit with Tools > NonToon > Brightness adjust (5). It lifts the whole result after this shadow has been applied, so the two compose instead of fighting."
msgstr "整体太暗、尤其是灯照不到的地方？用 Tools > NonToon > ⑤ 亮度调整 抬高材质的亮度下限（_LightMinLimit）。它是在本阴影**之后**整体抬亮的，所以两者是叠加关系、不会互相打架。"
